# Gitignored files copied into a fresh worktree from the primary checkout.
#
# Consumed two ways, for parity:
#   - `npm run worktree:init` (manual `git worktree add` path) — see scripts/worktree-init.sh
#   - the optional personal WorktreeCreate hook (EnterWorktree / --worktree / subagent isolation)
#
# This is an ALLOWLIST, not a blanket copy: node_modules is intentionally absent
# (worktree:init runs repository setup for a real install — never a symlink).
# Application environment files below are globbed against the
# primary checkout; zero matches are tolerated. Copied, never symlinked (a symlinked
# .env.local resolves outside the worktree and trips Vite's server.fs.allow).
.env.local
.env.*.local
